numinance.kinds.v1.ResidencyPolicySpec.j.description:
ResidencyPolicySpec holds the floors and the data-handling limits. Floor is the ResidencyFloors message with the five ADR 0019 classes (no IN_REGION or ANY value);
 inference residency is carried by floors (the derived class covers inference, ADR 0019) together with cross_region.
 training_use is a separate optional enum.
